>Nvidia's board is reportedly preparing to oust Jensen Huang amid reports of an affair with a suspected Chinese spy. The shake-up would leave the world's leading AI chip supplier without the co-founder who built it.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mississippi Senate race: Democrat Scott Colom defeats Republican Cindy Hyde-Smith</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f3e467cc858b9cb30662f7cee4536d4b51a0b843b09f19a4f0181e9f3b05db96</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T23:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mississippi-senate-race-democrat-scott-colom-defeats-republican-cindy-hyde-smith/a-79924938--fc149241f06d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mississippi-senate-race-democrat-scott-colom-defeats-republican-cindy-hyde-smith/a-79924938?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The southern US state of Mississippi has elected its first Black senator in more than 140 years. Democrat Scott Colom has won the seat in a historic upset, according to projections.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian Foreign Ministry says its ambassador to US has died</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bde94fa9f9f8085a7b41d4c457dad8933d5569a45c62446f8113f47a4ddbcc8a</id><updated>2026-11-12T16:54:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T23:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-foreign-ministry-says-its-ambassador-to-us-has-died/a-79924829--521886c8847c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-foreign-ministry-says-its-ambassador-to-us-has-died/a-79924829?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia's Foreign Ministry has said that Alexander Darchiev died from a chronic illness at the age of 66. The long-time diplomat had been in the Washington post since early 2025.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
